  "Data and text: CC BY 4.0, credit \"Follow the Money: Ukrainian Aid\". Every figure has its sources in the country breakdown and in the research files on GitHub. Figures to {date}.": "Dane i tekst: CC BY 4.0, z podaniem źródła „Follow the Money: Ukrainian Aid”. Każda liczba ma źródła w zestawieniu kraju i w plikach badawczych na GitHubie. Dane do {date}.",
